  "question": {
    "text": "<p>What is the major product expected from the following reaction?<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0d105fc9-c3bc-4646-bd1c-39991febc053-image.png\" style=\"width: 166px; height: 110px;\" /><br /><br />Where D is an isotope of hydrogen.</p>",
